# GitHub Pages Configuration

This file configures GitHub Pages to serve the Streamlit frontend.

## Instructions

1. Go to your repository Settings → Pages
2. Set Source to: `Deploy from a branch`
3. Select branch: `gh-pages` and folder: `/ (root)`
4. Click Save

The GitHub Actions workflow will automatically deploy the frontend to GitHub Pages.

## Access URL
After deployment, your frontend will be available at:
```
https://LY-muyanshiqi.github.io/thermal-peak-shaving-pumped-storage/
```
